PN,35201
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F352A1787855377
OL,3,CBritish Olympic champion targets
OL,4,Crecord eighth Games in LA
OL,6,FCarl Hester is aiming to become the
OL,7,Flongest-serving Olympian in British
OL,8,Fhistory.
OL,10,FThe 59-year-old dressage rider hails
OL,11,Ffrom the small Channel Island of Sark
OL,12,Fand has competed in seven Games so
OL,13,Ffar, winning four team medals -
OL,14,Fincluding gold at London 2012.
OL,16,FHe is currently tied with retired
OL,17,Fshowjumper Nick Skelton for the record
OL,18,Fof most Team GB appearances at the
OL,19,FOlympics.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,353,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F352A1787855377
OL,3,CBritish Olympic champion targets
OL,4,Crecord eighth Games in LA
OL,6,FHester would gallop into the lead if
OL,7,Fhe gets on the plane to Los Angeles in
OL,8,Ftwo years' time and he showed his
OL,9,Fworth as part of the dressage team
OL,10,Fwhich won silver at this month's World
OL,11,FChampionships, a result which saw them
OL,12,Fqualify for the Games.
OL,14,FSpeaking to ITV News about the
OL,15,Fpossibility of breaking the British
OL,16,Frecord, he explains: "I would love to
OL,17,Fhave that because my story coming from
OL,18,FSark is special and unique in its own
OL,19,Fcase, I was just brought up riding the
OL,20,Fcarriage horses there and followed my
OL,21,Fdream.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,353,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F352A1787855377
OL,3,CBritish Olympic champion targets
OL,4,Crecord eighth Games in LA
OL,6,F"I will definitely put myself in the
OL,7,Fmix. You have to allow yourself a
OL,8,Flittle bit of downtime after an
OL,9,FOlympic Games to actually decide if
OL,10,Fyou want to do this again because, as
OL,11,Fanybody can imagine, it takes a lot of
OL,12,Ftime and dedication.
OL,14,F"I never considered after Paris
OL,15,Fwhether I would go on or not, I just
OL,16,Fthought, 'Leave it, wait and just see
OL,17,Fhow I feel'.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,353,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F352A1787855377
OL,3,CBritish Olympic champion targets
OL,4,Crecord eighth Games in LA
OL,6,F"This year, I just felt the enthusiasm
OL,7,Ffor it again, it comes and goes
OL,8,Fthroughout your life. It's also about
OL,9,Fmy and the horse's health, I'm going
OL,10,Fto be 60 next year so I'll be getting
OL,11,Fon a bit in those Games.
OL,13,F"I'm grateful for the fact that it is
OL,14,Fa sport you can do later on, depending
OL,15,Fon your fitness."
OL,17,FHester adds: "I have been plugging
OL,18,Faway in this sport for 36 years now, I
OL,19,Fdid my first World Championship in
OL,20,F1990.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,353,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F352A1787855377
OL,3,CBritish Olympic champion targets
OL,4,Crecord eighth Games in LA
OL,6,F"I was the oldest competitor in Tokyo,
OL,7,Fbut I still feel good, fit and I'm
OL,8,Fstill looking forward to it. It has to
OL,9,Fbe mental as well and I really felt
OL,10,Fhappy this year to get back into the
OL,11,Fsport, go and enjoy some shows on my
OL,12,Fown.
OL,14,F"Teams are pressure, of course they
OL,15,Fare, because it needs all of you to do
OL,16,Fwell and if by any chance it doesn't
OL,17,Fand you're that individual that might
OL,18,Fsuffer that place, it can take its
OL,19,Ftoll.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,353,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F352A1787855377
OL,3,CBritish Olympic champion targets
OL,4,Crecord eighth Games in LA
OL,6,F"We just have to keep plugging on,
OL,7,Fkeep training and let's see if we can
OL,8,Fbring home another medal in LA,
OL,9,Fbecause that will be the fifth
OL,10,FOlympics in a row where we've
OL,11,Fsucceeded in doing that."
OL,13,FHowever, Hester acknowledges that it
OL,14,Fwill not be easy for anyone to secure
OL,15,Fa spot.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,353,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F352A1787855377
OL,3,CBritish Olympic champion targets
OL,4,Crecord eighth Games in LA
OL,6,FHe describes: "They won't put me on
OL,7,Fthe team because I've done seven
OL,8,FOlympic Games, you have to be fair to
OL,9,Fall athletes. There are hundreds and
OL,10,Fthousands of people that would love to
OL,11,Fbe on the Olympic team, but it has to
OL,12,Fbe the three best.
OL,14,F"At the World Games and the European
OL,15,FChampionships, there's four riders on
OL,16,Fthe team. If one has a bad day, it
OL,17,Fdoesn't matter because the top three
OL,18,Fscores count. At the Olympic Games,
OL,19,Fthey take that fourth person away so
OL,20,Fthe pressure is really on everybody.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G7/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,353,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F352A1787855377
OL,3,CBritish Olympic champion targets
OL,4,Crecord eighth Games in LA
OL,6,F"It will be important to pick people
OL,7,Fwith experience but also to be fair to
OL,8,Feverybody else trying to get on the
OL,9,Fteam, the top three scorers of that
OL,10,Fyear will go and that will be decided
OL,11,Fprobably only six weeks before the
OL,12,FOlympic Games in LA."
OL,14,FWith a population of only around 500
OL,15,Fpeople, Hester is very proud of his
OL,16,FSark roots and it is reciprocated - a
OL,17,Fgold postbox stands in the island's
OL,18,Fhigh street to commemorate his London
OL,19,F2012 success.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G8/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,353,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F352A1787855377
OL,3,CBritish Olympic champion targets
OL,4,Crecord eighth Games in LA
OL,6,FRecounting his childhood, he
OL,7,Fremembers: "I always knew, even back
OL,8,Fin those days, I just wanted to ride
OL,9,Fand I still don't know why because my
OL,10,FMum and Dad do not enjoy horses; they
OL,11,Flove watching me compete of course but
OL,12,FI am from a non-horsey family.
OL,14,F"I put it down to and thank Sark for
OL,15,Fgiving me my love of horses and the
OL,16,Ffact I was able to move to the UK to
OL,17,Ffollow my dreams.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G9/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,353,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F352A1787855377
OL,3,CBritish Olympic champion targets
OL,4,Crecord eighth Games in LA
OL,6,F"My Dad and Uncle still live on Sark
OL,7,Fso I'm able to return, I was there
OL,8,Fjust three weeks ago and I love taking
OL,9,Fpeople back to the Channel Islands
OL,10,Fbecause it is unique and special.
OL,12,F"Sark, especially, with the fact it
OL,13,Fhas no cars and everybody gets to
OL,14,Fexercise when they're there which, the
OL,15,Folder you get, becomes more important.
OL,17,F"I think people just can't quite
OL,18,Fbelieve how I've ended up competing
OL,19,Fcoming from there, so I love taking
OL,20,Fpeople back just to see what the best
OL,21,Fisland is really like."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws        G10/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
